[1m[38;5;231mWhere should preferences persist?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mDevice-local localStorage (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mBrowser localStorage, single shared key. No backend. Per-device, not per-user.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m localStorage keyed by user
     [38;5;246mSame, but namespaced by the logged-in username. Separates users on a shared device; no security boundary.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Server-backed per account
     [38;5;246mReal per-user persistence across devices. Requires building a backend and real auth — login() is currently a stub.[39m
